diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index dceed82..5f23342 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -13,7 +13,12 @@ Settings come from built-in defaults, then the config file given with
 | `[sync] endpoint`     | `SYNC_ENDPOINT`           | `http://localhost:8080/api` |
 | `[sync] timeout`      | `SYNC_TIMEOUT`            | `10` (seconds)              |
 | `[retry] max_attempts`| `SYNC_RETRY_MAX_ATTEMPTS` | `4`                         |
-| `[retry] delay`       | `SYNC_RETRY_DELAY`        | `2` (seconds between tries) |
+| `[retry] backoff_base`| `SYNC_RETRY_BACKOFF_BASE` | `1` (seconds)               |
+| `[retry] backoff_max` | `SYNC_RETRY_BACKOFF_MAX`  | `30` (seconds)              |
+
+Retries back off exponentially: the wait before retry n is `backoff_base * 2**(n-1)`
+seconds, capped at `backoff_max` (which must be at least `backoff_base`). The old
+`[retry] delay` key is still read, as `backoff_base`.
 
 See `settings.example.ini`. Print the effective settings with:
 
